eived\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... 147 Breaks at the World Championships\\n\\nIn what must rank as one pinnacle of a snooker player's career, there have been just 15 occurrences of a 147 break at the snooker World Championship Finals up to the end of the 2025 season. However, the ultimate was Mark ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.olbg.com/blogs/snooker-maximum-breaks\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... He has compiled more than 800 century breaks in professional competition, including six maximum breaks, one of which is the only one to have been made during the final of the World Championships.\\n\\nSelby is also an accomplished pool player. He won the WEPF World Eightball Championship in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Selby\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d9\"},\"ref\":\"d9\",\"snippet\":\" ... And when a player is making 80, ton, 90, it's because they're in the zone, not because the table has afforded them a bit of slack.\\n\\nWell said Prop\\n\\n-\\n\\nSnookerEd25\\n\\n- Posts: 24676\\n\\n- Joined: 10 October 2011\\n\\n- Location: West London\\n\\n- Snooker Idol: Cliff Wilson\\n\\n- Highest Break: 53 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.snookerisland.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=722&t=13431\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is the first left-handed player to win the World Championship. He has compiled over 600 century breaks in professional competition, including three maximums, and has won over £8 million in prize money over the course of his career. He is one of the three players collectively ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Williams_%28snooker_player%29\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... His 500th century was recorded on 15 November 2007, in the second frame of his Premier League match against Neil Robertson.\\n\\nBy the start of the 2010–11 snooker season, O'Sullivan had made 597 century breaks. He made one century in the Players Tour Championship 2010/2011 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_and_century_breaks_made_by_Ronnie_O%27Sullivan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\" ... He became the tenth player to win the Masters more than once. There were 26 century breaks, with the highest being a 139 made by Stuart Bingham in his first-round loss to Kyren Wilson.\\n\\nOverview\\n\\nThe Masters is an invitational snooker tournament first held in 1975. Organised ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Masters_(snooker)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... There were 20 century breaks made in Group 3, the highest of which was a 140 made by Selby.\\n:Note: Ronnie O'Sullivan played five matches, then subsequently withdrew and did not compete further. He was not replaced by another player, and the group continued as a sixplayer ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_Championship_League_(invitational)\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f3867