erful player.\\\" Hawkins's defeat meant that he had lost all three Triple Crown finals he had reached, having previously been runner-up to O'Sullivan in the 2013 World Snooker Championship and the 2016 Masters.\\n\\nTournament draw\\n\\nNumbers given on the left show the players' seedings in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Masters_(snooker)\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2a634b8a7f91eb9ab797e2375c76a534a3e5049fa7916e4bb10d7d7141ff8baa\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"2041d03e4ec14ca0eeae0758631d776587953b4b081494f1cd4f0f3679e5417c\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"snooker player turned professional 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2017, he won the World Championship three times in four years. He first became world number one in September 2011, and held onto the top ranking position for just over four years between February 2015 and March 2019. He has compiled more than 800 century breaks in professional ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Selby\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2023\\n\\nThe 2022 World Snooker Championship (officially the 2022 Betfred World Snooker Championship) was a professional snooker tournament that took place from 16 April to 2 May 2022 at the Crucible Theatre in Sheffield, England, the 46th consecutive year the World Snooker Championship was held at the venue ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_World_Snooker_Championship\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... By the start of the 2010–11 snooker season, O'Sullivan had made 597 century breaks. He made one century in the Players Tour Championship 2010/2011 – Event 1, and four during the Players Tour Championship 2010/2011 – Event 4 which was played from 14 to 16 August ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maximum_and_century_breaks_made_by_Ronnie_O%27Sullivan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\" ... Organised by the World Snooker Tour, the 2022 Masters was the 48th staging of the tournament. It was the second Triple Crown event of the 2021–22 snooker season, following the 2021 UK Championship and preceding the 2022 World Snooker Championship. Held between 9 and 16 January 2022 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Masters_(snooker)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2010s | 86 | 0 | 300 | 44 |\\n\\n| 2020s | 53 | 1 | 208 | 34 |\\n\\nNote how the wait between 147 breaks occurring has come down as sharply as the occurrence has increased. From waiting up to 1389 days in the 80s to see one, and an average of 1 per year, snooker ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.olbg.com/blogs/snooker-maximum-breaks\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is partially colour blind and has difficulty distinguishing between the red balls and the brown.\\n\\nWilliams is nicknamed the \\\"Welsh Potting Machine\\\". He has won over £8 million in prize money during his career.\\n\\nPersonal life\\n\\nIn 2010, Williams became co-owner of Tredegar Snooker Hall in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Williams_%28snooker_player%29\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... Runner-up | 1. | 2017 | CVB Snooker Challenge | | | 9–26 |\\n\\nPro-am finals: 4 (2 titles)\\n\\n**Table 10**\\n\\n| Outcome | No. | Year | Championship | Opponent in the final | Score |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| Winner | 1. | 2002 | Asian Games | | 3–1 |\\n| Winner | 2. | 2006 | Asian Games (2) | | 4–2 |\\n| Runner-up | 1. | 2010 | Asian Games | | 2 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ding_Junhui\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... She qualified in 2001 to referee on the World Snooker Tour and was the sport's highest profile female referee for the next 14 years. She became the first woman to officiate at a professional ranking snooker tournament at the 2002 Welsh Open, and the first woman to ... \",\"title\":\"https://pantheon.world/profile/occupation/referee/country/united-kingdom\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... All but two events on the professional snooker tour in 2007/2008 are played in the United Kingdom, and the World Championship has been played at The Crucible Theatre, Sheffield, since 1977. There are many amateur leagues set up across the country, featuring team matches between snooker clubs ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sport_in_the_United_Kingdom\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\